1
00:00:11,904 --> 00:00:15,308
C'est où, sur cette photo ?
Where is this in the photo?

2
00:00:15,408 --> 00:00:21,212
C'est la maison de mes grands-parents. C'était en 2010.
That's my grandparents' house. It was in 2010.

3
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:25,148
Il y avait un grand arbre devant la maison !
There was a big tree in front of the house!

4
00:00:25,248 --> 00:00:31,148
Oui, mais il n'y a plus d'arbre maintenant. Il était vieux.
Yes, but there's no tree any more. It was old.

5
00:00:31,248 --> 00:00:35,180
Et ta grand-mère, elle est sur la photo ?
And your grandmother, is she in the photo?

6
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:43,196
Oui, elle portait toujours un tablier. Elle ne cuisine plus, mais elle fait encore des gâteaux.
Yes, she always wore an apron. She doesn't cook any more, but she still bakes cakes.
